Package: betaCalendarsR
Type: Package
Title: Deterministic Calendar Grids and Date Planning Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mateo", "Pedersen", email = "betacalendars@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for generating deterministic month, year, and date-range
    calendar structures from base R dates. Configurable week starts, fixed and
    compact month grids, adjacent-month cells, ISO week metadata, calendar
    boundaries, and bounded recurrence helpers support reporting, dashboards,
    scheduling interfaces, tests, and other applications that separate
    calendar structure from rendering.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://www.betacalendars.com/,
    https://beta-calendar.r-universe.dev/betaCalendarsR,
    https://github.com/Beta-Calendar/betaCalendarsR
BugReports: https://github.com/Beta-Calendar/betaCalendarsR/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
X-schema.org-keywords: calendar, date-time, calendar-grid, date-range,
    planner, schedule, recurrence, year-month, reporting
